(7488740, 1192237, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is like a specimen tree, terrific detail and modeling. 7 for now, likely bump later.</td>', 'Whoa, this is like a specimen tree, terrific detail and modeling. 7 for now, likely bump later.', '2016-12-26 00:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
