(7489053, 1191975, 182284, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and very pretty tree.</td>', 'Nice shot and very pretty tree.', '2016-12-28 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489057, 1192361, 182284, '<td valign="top">Amazing trees. Great Shot.</td>', 'Amazing trees. Great Shot.', '2016-12-28 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489143, 1192125, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is my all time favorite. It''s well composed and the snow only enhances the tree and view in the background. I would love to be there. Gorgeous!</td>', 'This is my all time favorite. It''s well composed and the snow only enhances the tree and view in the background. I would love to be there. Gorgeous!', '2016-12-28 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489144, 1192195, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed shot and the fog has rolled in with perfect timing. I don''t see a thing I would do differently except maybe add a little toning.</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed shot and the fog has rolled in with perfect timing. I don''t see a thing I would do differently except maybe add a little toning.', '2016-12-28 17:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489145, 1192436, 182284, '<td valign="top">Here is another example of winter trees. Living in the south, I do love the changing seasons, where trees without the leaves, gives a mystical feel along lakes and streams when the fog rolls in. I love the composition and coloring you left in the photo. Great Job.</td>', 'Here is another example of winter trees. Living in the south, I do love the changing seasons, where trees without the leaves, gives a mystical feel along lakes and streams when the fog rolls in. I love the composition and coloring you left in the photo. Great Job.', '2016-12-28 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489146, 1191935, 182284, '<td valign="top">Now if you aren''t in the Holiday mood after seeing this, I don''t know what would work. This is a lovely shot and the colors have perfect illumination and contrast. Pretty enough for a Christmas card. The only thing I may have done is remove the man.</td>', 'Now if you aren''t in the Holiday mood after seeing this, I don''t know what would work. This is a lovely shot and the colors have perfect illumination and contrast. Pretty enough for a Christmas card. The only thing I may have done is remove the man.', '2016-12-28 17:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489147, 1192097, 182284, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous huge tree. What a find! I think I would like to have seen a little more of the limbs along with the huge trunk. Did you lie on the ground when taking this photo? Never the less, I really admire large trees and gave you a nice score on it.</td>', 'What a gorgeous huge tree. What a find! I think I would like to have seen a little more of the limbs along with the huge trunk. Did you lie on the ground when taking this photo? Never the less, I really admire large trees and gave you a nice score on it.', '2016-12-28 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489148, 1192064, 182284, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is some of the snow we''ve been hearing about. You simply cannot go wrong with snow photos. Very nice. 9</td>', 'Oh my, this is some of the snow we''ve been hearing about. You simply cannot go wrong with snow photos. Very nice. 9', '2016-12-28 17:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489149, 1192287, 182284, '<td valign="top">Well the field may be over looked but the trees sitting atop the hill surly won''t be missed in this shot. Lovely composition and I love the soft hue you left in the photo.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Well the field may be over looked but the trees sitting atop the hill surly won''t be missed in this shot. Lovely composition and I love the soft hue you left in the photo.Very nice.', '2016-12-28 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489150, 1192457, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very Artsy photo. I love it. You''ve done an awesome job.</td>', 'Very Artsy photo. I love it. You''ve done an awesome job.', '2016-12-28 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489151, 1192295, 182284, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a young tree covered with frost. We''re still waiting for our first snow of the year.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a young tree covered with frost. We''re still waiting for our first snow of the year.', '2016-12-28 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489153, 1192357, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very nice find. Of course I love the colors of the bark. It makes me wonder if it''s from the Aspen. If it were mine, I may would have positioned the bark diagonally instead of straight across. This will do well. 7</td>', 'Very nice find. Of course I love the colors of the bark. It makes me wonder if it''s from the Aspen. If it were mine, I may would have positioned the bark diagonally instead of straight across. This will do well. 7', '2016-12-28 17:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489154, 1192125, 43774, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Best in the challenge.</td>', 'Stunning. Best in the challenge.', '2016-12-28 18:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489156, 1192097, 24983, '<td valign="top">good viewpoint</td>', 'good viewpoint', '2016-12-28 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489189, 1192361, 185233, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. It is how I envisioned Middle Earth!</td>', 'This is lovely. It is how I envisioned Middle Earth!', '2016-12-28 20:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489223, 1192248, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter and the gnarly nature of the trunk and branches.  If I had any criticism it would be that the photo seems to have a touch more noise reduction or Lightroom luminance than I generally like.  It''s just a personal preference of course.  I would still give this a front page finish. 8</td>', 'I like the subject matter and the gnarly nature of the trunk and branches.  If I had any criticism it would be that the photo seems to have a touch more noise reduction or Lightroom luminance than I generally like.  It''s just a personal preference of course.  I would still give this a front page finish. 8', '2016-12-29 02:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489224, 1191935, 37858, '<td valign="top">I would award a ribbon for this image.Great colors and reflections. 8</td>', 'I would award a ribbon for this image.Great colors and reflections. 8', '2016-12-29 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489225, 1191975, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like what I perceive to be a duo-tone treatment in this image.  Your selection of aperture is also a pleasing one, giving clarity to the foreground tree and blurring the background well.  I would give this a ribbon. 8</td>', 'I like what I perceive to be a duo-tone treatment in this image.  Your selection of aperture is also a pleasing one, giving clarity to the foreground tree and blurring the background well.  I would give this a ribbon. 8', '2016-12-29 02:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489226, 1192378, 37858, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the fallen trunk frames much of the ocean, including the lone person in the water.  I also like your tonal values.  They are different from what I often see (and do myself) and quite pleasing - almost like faded film development from the 70''s.  I would give this a first page finish. 8</td>', 'I really like the way the fallen trunk frames much of the ocean, including the lone person in the water.  I also like your tonal values.  They are different from what I often see (and do myself) and quite pleasing - almost like faded film development from the 70''s.  I would give this a first page finish. 8', '2016-12-29 02:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489227, 1192195, 37858, '<td valign="top">Excellent atmosphere, with the bright sky gradually becoming darker and more misty as one looks lower.  A very pleasing and calm image.  The one criticism I have is what looks to me to be heavy burning on the lower right branches as the atmosphere at that location seems unnaturally darker than nearby atmosphere.  Nevertheless, I would give it a ribbon. 8</td>', 'Excellent atmosphere, with the bright sky gradually becoming darker and more misty as one looks lower.  A very pleasing and calm image.  The one criticism I have is what looks to me to be heavy burning on the lower right branches as the atmosphere at that location seems unnaturally darker than nearby atmosphere.  Nevertheless, I would give it a ribbon. 8', '2016-12-29 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489228, 1192125, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is very well photographed and I suspect many will vote this into a front page finish.  My only criticism (very minor at that) is that the tree could benefit from some selective sharpening.  It looks to me to be equally sharp with the background, something that I doubt was true when you were on site.  Still, I think this photo is a strong contender.  7</td>', 'This is very well photographed and I suspect many will vote this into a front page finish.  My only criticism (very minor at that) is that the tree could benefit from some selective sharpening.  It looks to me to be equally sharp with the background, something that I doubt was true when you were on site.  Still, I think this photo is a strong contender.  7', '2016-12-29 02:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489229, 1192237, 37858, '<td valign="top">A very enjoyable image.  Nicely executed with a bit of a story revealed in the dog and people in the background.  7</td>', 'A very enjoyable image.  Nicely executed with a bit of a story revealed in the dog and people in the background.  7', '2016-12-29 02:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489230, 1192361, 37858, '<td valign="top">I love these trees.  They can be found all over the island where I live.  You have a nice depth of field, keeping the foreground as sharp as the center of the tree.  Something that might make the photo even more interesting would be a person (perhaps a child) walking along the level branch/trunk on the right side at roughly the upper one-third point.  That would give my eye somewhere to rest.  Still, a fine effort.  7</td>', 'I love these trees.  They can be found all over the island where I live.  You have a nice depth of field, keeping the foreground as sharp as the center of the tree.  Something that might make the photo even more interesting would be a person (perhaps a child) walking along the level branch/trunk on the right side at roughly the upper one-third point.  That would give my eye somewhere to rest.  Still, a fine effort.  7', '2016-12-29 02:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489231, 1192254, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  It takes my eyes right into the center of the image to the back snowline.  I wish there was a feature at that point.  Maybe a dog or someone coming out of the background.  Still, I like it enough to score this with a 7.</td>', 'I like this image.  It takes my eyes right into the center of the image to the back snowline.  I wish there was a feature at that point.  Maybe a dog or someone coming out of the background.  Still, I like it enough to score this with a 7.', '2016-12-29 02:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489232, 1192436, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting view and very calming.  I like the shape of the silhouetted tree especially.  Unfortunately, there is some thin haloing on both sides of the trunk and to a lesser degree at various places in the branches.  I suspect that your sharpening was a bit too strong.  The far shoreline with soft, muted trees and reflections is particularly appealing.  I like this well enough (even with the halos) to give this a 7.</td>', 'This is an interesting view and very calming.  I like the shape of the silhouetted tree especially.  Unfortunately, there is some thin haloing on both sides of the trunk and to a lesser degree at various places in the branches.  I suspect that your sharpening was a bit too strong.  The far shoreline with soft, muted trees and reflections is particularly appealing.  I like this well enough (even with the halos) to give this a 7.', '2016-12-29 02:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489233, 1192419, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is an iconic winter scene for many people and you have photographed it very well in terms of clarity and depth of field.  The colors are good too.  While my first reaction was to appreciate the diagonal fence, the longer I looked at this photograph the less it seemed helpful to the composition.  I have finally decided that the fence takes my eye out of the image, ending as it does half way up the left edge of the picture.  It also acts as a subtle border across the front of the photo, impeding my eyes'' desire to run deep into the image.  It''s an interesting fence, though, so all is not lost on me.  I like the image overall, and easily give it a 7.<br/> <br/>(Note, I am no expert myself, so take my thoughts with a grain of sand.  I offer them simply because many people are requesting more feedback.  Hopefully studying others'' images will help me be more careful with my own.)</td>', 'This is an iconic winter scene for many people and you have photographed it very well in terms of clarity and depth of field.  The colors are good too.  While my first reaction was to appreciate the diagonal fence, the longer I looked at this photograph the less it seemed helpful to the composition.  I have finally decided that the fence takes my eye out of the image, ending as it does half way up the left edge of the picture.  It also acts as a subtle border across the front of the photo, impeding my eyes'' desire to run deep into the image.  It''s an interesting fence, though, so all is not lost on me.  I like the image overall, and easily give it a 7. (Note, I am no expert myself, so take my thoughts with a grain of sand.  I offer them simply because many people are requesting more feedback.  Hopefully studying others'' images will help me be more careful with my own.)', '2016-12-29 02:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489234, 1192441, 37858, '<td valign="top">What an interesting landscape.  I''d love to see more of it.  7</td>', 'What an interesting landscape.  I''d love to see more of it.  7', '2016-12-29 02:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489235, 1192394, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, bordering on minimalism.  I wish the fence and the metal fixture on the building were not present as they (to my way of thinking) do not help with the strong lines of this image.  Still, I like the image as is (and realize, of course, that you can''t do anything about the fence or metal fixture).  I like the clouds, the straight lines and repeating patterns of the building''s lines, windows, and bolt heads.  6</td>', 'This is an interesting image, bordering on minimalism.  I wish the fence and the metal fixture on the building were not present as they (to my way of thinking) do not help with the strong lines of this image.  Still, I like the image as is (and realize, of course, that you can''t do anything about the fence or metal fixture).  I like the clouds, the straight lines and repeating patterns of the building''s lines, windows, and bolt heads.  6', '2016-12-29 02:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489236, 1192442, 37858, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I almost missed the point when first viewing the image as I was focused on the shape of the branches.  Then the light bulb went off and the leaves became obvious.  I guess that you are shooting into the light (or perhaps it is just processing).  I would like to see this with less haze.   6</td>', 'Very creative.  I almost missed the point when first viewing the image as I was focused on the shape of the branches.  Then the light bulb went off and the leaves became obvious.  I guess that you are shooting into the light (or perhaps it is just processing).  I would like to see this with less haze.   6', '2016-12-29 02:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489237, 1192351, 37858, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a fine quiet mood in this image.  Snow-dusted trees and grounds, with a couple enjoying the moment.  I suspect there were no sounds being made when you were on site.  The photo has a nice balance to it and a warm glow from the lights.  The foreground, though, doesn''t add much to the image.  I would consider cropping off the bottom half of the water, just below what look like ice crystals.  The bottom inch is not in focus in any event.  Overall, I like your results.  6</td>', 'You''ve captured a fine quiet mood in this image.  Snow-dusted trees and grounds, with a couple enjoying the moment.  I suspect there were no sounds being made when you were on site.  The photo has a nice balance to it and a warm glow from the lights.  The foreground, though, doesn''t add much to the image.  I would consider cropping off the bottom half of the water, just below what look like ice crystals.  The bottom inch is not in focus in any event.  Overall, I like your results.  6', '2016-12-29 02:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489238, 1192380, 37858, '<td valign="top">A nice sharp image with good color and interesting curves in the trunks and reflections.  I would consider cropping off most of the sky, which would draw attention to the trees and reflections and move the horizon away from the center line of the image.  I would not crop off the bottom, though, because the water is framing the reflections.  6</td>', 'A nice sharp image with good color and interesting curves in the trunks and reflections.  I would consider cropping off most of the sky, which would draw attention to the trees and reflections and move the horizon away from the center line of the image.  I would not crop off the bottom, though, because the water is framing the reflections.  6', '2016-12-29 03:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489239, 1192353, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed sunburst in this image.  I''m not sure the stuff in the foreground is interesting enough to be the focal point of the image.  Just my two cents.  6</td>', 'Nicely executed sunburst in this image.  I''m not sure the stuff in the foreground is interesting enough to be the focal point of the image.  Just my two cents.  6', '2016-12-29 03:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489240, 1192368, 37858, '<td valign="top">I wanted to like this image more.  The line of trees is very eye-catching and the color of the sky is also appealing.  What troubled me was what I perceive to be a lack of sharp focus on the tops of all those great trees.  There is also some white spots in the background.  I''m not sure whether they are haloing or something else.  Unfortunately, IMHO they detract from the photograph as does the soft focus at the tree tops.  Still, the composition is appealing to me.  6</td>', 'I wanted to like this image more.  The line of trees is very eye-catching and the color of the sky is also appealing.  What troubled me was what I perceive to be a lack of sharp focus on the tops of all those great trees.  There is also some white spots in the background.  I''m not sure whether they are haloing or something else.  Unfortunately, IMHO they detract from the photograph as does the soft focus at the tree tops.  Still, the composition is appealing to me.  6', '2016-12-29 03:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489261, 1192351, 104920, '<td valign="top">love the scenery</td>', 'love the scenery', '2016-12-29 09:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489580, 1192361, 163081, '<td valign="top">Very nice, in my top 3. A 9 from me. My Red Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very nice, in my top 3. A 9 from me. My Red Dragon Award', '2016-12-30 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489581, 1192295, 163081, '<td valign="top">Very seasonal picture, I can feel the cold just by looking at the picture. Nice natural colors with a strong framing. An 8 from me. Also my Yellow Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very seasonal picture, I can feel the cold just by looking at the picture. Nice natural colors with a strong framing. An 8 from me. Also my Yellow Dragon Award', '2016-12-30 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
