(7489600, 1192208, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how you challenge the viewer with this cleverly hidden pair<br/> <br/>(looks like a Bruegel and Durer collaboration)</td>', 'I like how you challenge the viewer with this cleverly hidden pair (looks like a Bruegel and Durer collaboration)', '2016-12-30 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489638, 1192418, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think the overall concept of this photo is great.  Some things I wish were different in the end result: 1) an isolated subject - if you could have taken a different position to get this small tree without the background ... 2) exposure is maybe .5 to .7 underexposed ... 3) white balance is just a little too cool (blue) IMO.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the overall concept of this photo is great.  Some things I wish were different in the end result: 1) an isolated subject - if you could have taken a different position to get this small tree without the background ... 2) exposure is maybe .5 to .7 underexposed ... 3) white balance is just a little too cool (blue) IMO. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2016-12-30 17:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
