(7489862, 1192125, 114285, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery! Kind of wish you left more room above, tree seems to be squished into the frame somewhat. Nevertheless you''re in my top picks.</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery! Kind of wish you left more room above, tree seems to be squished into the frame somewhat. Nevertheless you''re in my top picks.', '2017-01-01 07:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
