(7489875, 1191951, 81362, '<td valign="top">Color and abstraction combine nicely here. Your unconventional artistry results in a very beautiful image.</td>', 'Color and abstraction combine nicely here. Your unconventional artistry results in a very beautiful image.', '2017-01-01 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489910, 1192195, 104920, '<td valign="top">rooting to be top 3, my favourite in the challenge</td>', 'rooting to be top 3, my favourite in the challenge', '2017-01-01 16:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489988, 1192212, 150202, '<td valign="top">The colors are really nice, however the focus is on the second seed or maybe the leaf which causes the front out of focus seed to be a distraction for me.  I do like how the far background is soft yet colorful.</td>', 'The colors are really nice, however the focus is on the second seed or maybe the leaf which causes the front out of focus seed to be a distraction for me.  I do like how the far background is soft yet colorful.', '2017-01-01 20:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489989, 1192449, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting patterns the trees make, I just feels a little off to me missing so much of the trunk. I''d like to see more (maybe framed vertical) or less of the trunk, but that might be just me. The light you have captured is wonderful.</td>', 'I like the interesting patterns the trees make, I just feels a little off to me missing so much of the trunk. I''d like to see more (maybe framed vertical) or less of the trunk, but that might be just me. The light you have captured is wonderful.', '2017-01-01 20:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489991, 1192357, 150202, '<td valign="top">Too much of the bark is out of focus for me. If it was in context then I would assume the focal point is just what is in focus, but since it''s on a dark background it makes it seem like everything is the subject, but some of it''s out of focus, if that makes sense.  Using the bark as art is a fantastic idea though, I''d love to see this idea expanded even more!</td>', 'Too much of the bark is out of focus for me. If it was in context then I would assume the focal point is just what is in focus, but since it''s on a dark background it makes it seem like everything is the subject, but some of it''s out of focus, if that makes sense.  Using the bark as art is a fantastic idea though, I''d love to see this idea expanded even more!', '2017-01-01 20:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489994, 1191914, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the spookiness of this scene. I think maybe the moon and tree are too far apart so my eye isn''t sure where to go. Curious how this would look if you slide the angle more from under the tree.  The captured light in the clouds is beautiful.</td>', 'I like the spookiness of this scene. I think maybe the moon and tree are too far apart so my eye isn''t sure where to go. Curious how this would look if you slide the angle more from under the tree.  The captured light in the clouds is beautiful.', '2017-01-01 20:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489995, 1192456, 150202, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, I can''t even tell it it''s a person or tree.  It is a bit too bright for me, especially near the top it seems washed out too much. Very creative take on the subject.</td>', 'Interesting concept, I can''t even tell it it''s a person or tree.  It is a bit too bright for me, especially near the top it seems washed out too much. Very creative take on the subject.', '2017-01-01 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489998, 1192378, 150202, '<td valign="top">The trees, the water, the light are all beautiful, but for some reason it didn''t invoke the wow factor for me. I think maybe it''s the composition having both the horizon at the midpoint and the bend of the tree in the middle. It''s still a nice shot, especially with the light on the grass.</td>', 'The trees, the water, the light are all beautiful, but for some reason it didn''t invoke the wow factor for me. I think maybe it''s the composition having both the horizon at the midpoint and the bend of the tree in the middle. It''s still a nice shot, especially with the light on the grass.', '2017-01-01 20:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490000, 1192442, 150202, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, I''m curious how you created this. The leaves are not as sharp as I would like. Or alternatively not as soft as I would like.  Very creative though!</td>', 'Cool idea, I''m curious how you created this. The leaves are not as sharp as I would like. Or alternatively not as soft as I would like.  Very creative though!', '2017-01-01 20:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490001, 1192379, 150202, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the creativity, but for me the reflections detract from the subject of tree, instead of enhancing it. I end up looking at the building instead. I do like the monochrome choice and the contrast of light.</td>', 'I appreciate the creativity, but for me the reflections detract from the subject of tree, instead of enhancing it. I end up looking at the building instead. I do like the monochrome choice and the contrast of light.', '2017-01-01 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490003, 1192440, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like that I can almost fell the bark of the tree, and the light coming through the leaves is magical. The composition is just right. My top pick.</td>', 'I like that I can almost fell the bark of the tree, and the light coming through the leaves is magical. The composition is just right. My top pick.', '2017-01-01 21:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490004, 1192361, 150202, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject. The symmetry works well and the composition makes me feel as I''m in the tree. Might have just a smidge of a green cast, but overall this is amazing! Love it!</td>', 'Very cool subject. The symmetry works well and the composition makes me feel as I''m in the tree. Might have just a smidge of a green cast, but overall this is amazing! Love it!', '2017-01-01 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
