(7490273, 1192125, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. I love this, it is just so pretty! You are deserving to ''own'' the tree. The tree is lucky to have you.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. I love this, it is just so pretty! You are deserving to ''own'' the tree. The tree is lucky to have you.', '2017-01-03 04:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
